# Panel 261's R8 (2026-11-26, ratified): a record holding, as a field, a
# function value that takes the record, no mark anywhere. Found by the
# sitting's compiler-engineer: `check` passed and `build` exited 2, *unknown
# type name*, at the base and on `main` before this repair, the function
# type's typedef written before the struct it names and the struct after the
# typedef its field needs, a cycle the walk of `emit/typeorder.hero` took for
# a tree. C needs no complete struct in a function declarator that defines
# nothing, so the struct is declared ahead of the typedef. Prints 13.
record Box
    n: i64
    f: (function(Box, i64) -> i64)

function add_n(b: Box, x: i64) -> i64
    return b.n + x

function main()
    b = Box(n: 3, f: add_n)
    print(b.f(b, 10))
